                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On April 28, Chancellor Adenauer addressed to the Allied High Commission a letter
                    regarding establishment of a Federal police force. An English translation is
                    quoted in telegram 205 from Bonn, <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </div>
